achievement-SetWaypoint = 更新路径点
achievement-OpenDiary = 打开技能书
achievement-FullInventory = 装满物品栏
achievement-Respawned = 死后重生
achievement-RecipeAvailable = 收集足够的材料来制作物品
achievement-OpenCrafting = 打开制作窗口
achievement-EnergyLow = 耗尽耐力
achievement-ReceivedChatMsg = 收到聊天消息
